    LIMITS: 1-D EFE approximation (g = nu((g_N + g_eN)/a0) g_N); the LMC at 50 kpc is a tidal, time-dependent field rather than a uniform one; asymmetric-drift and
    disequilibrium systematics (LMC, Sgr, warp) not modelled; published tables not ingested (slope as quoted, normalisation Eilers-anchored).

